flowchart LR
    A[Applicant User]
    B[Admin User]

    subgraph FE[Frontend]
      UI[React Frontend]
    end

    subgraph GW[API Gateway]
      OCELOT[Ocelot Gateway\nJWT validation + route claims]
    end

    subgraph MS[Backend Microservices]
      AUTH[Auth Service]
      APP[Application Service]
      DOC[Document Service]
      ADM[Admin Service]
      NOTIF[Notification Service]
    end

    subgraph INFRA[Infrastructure]
      MQ[RabbitMQ]
      SQL[(SQL Server)]
      FS[(Document Upload Storage)]
    end

    A --> UI
    B --> UI
    UI --> OCELOT

    OCELOT --> AUTH
    OCELOT --> APP
    OCELOT --> DOC
    OCELOT --> ADM

    AUTH --> SQL
    APP --> SQL
    DOC --> SQL
    ADM --> SQL
    DOC --> FS

    APP -. publishes ApplicationSubmittedEvent .-> MQ
    MQ -. delivers ApplicationSubmittedEvent .-> DOC
    DOC -. sends UpdateApplicationStatusCommand .-> MQ
    MQ -. delivers UpdateApplicationStatusCommand .-> APP
    DOC -. publishes DocumentsVerifiedEvent .-> MQ
    MQ -. delivers DocumentsVerifiedEvent .-> ADM
    MQ -. delivers notification events .-> NOTIF

    ADM -->|internal HTTP| APP
    ADM -->|internal HTTP| DOC
    APP -->|internal HTTP callback| ADM
    DOC -->|internal HTTP fallback| APP